            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Open Optimod Remote 0.3.0</h2>
<p>The first signed release with automatic updates. Limited scope: not yet a complete replacement for Orban's Windows PC Remote.</p>
<ul>
<li>Several processors at once, one tab and session each.</li>
<li>Native windows for Connections, Presets, System Settings, Automation, Security and Diagnostics.</li>
<li>Supports the OPTIMOD 5700i, 5500i, 5500, 8700HD, 6300, 8700i, 2300 and 8400 at the firmware versions listed in the compatibility table.</li>
<li>An update never ends a processor session by itself: choose Disconnect and Install, or Later.</li>
</ul>
<p><a href="https://github.com/marktunzi/open-optimod-remote/blob/main/docs/releases/v0.3.0.md">Release notes and compatibility table</a></p>
]]></description>
